dgxtop-dual

This project contains code adapted from dgxtop by GigCoder.ai and DGXTOP
contributors: https://github.com/GigCoder-ai/dgxtop

The adapted dgxtop code retains the Apache License, Version 2.0, reproduced in
LICENSE-APACHE. LICENSE contains the MIT license for this project's additions.

Changes made in 2026 include two-host collection and display, SSH streaming,
terminal scrolling, metric accuracy fixes, and reduced sampling overhead.
